                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1634,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1634,
                            "last_played": 1793859981
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very good game so far, but it's incomplete. The game hints at a grander story or conspiracy with a taste of what's to come. From what I can tell, it's developed by a single person, so updates look to be really slow. Look forward to the 0.2.0 update that is slated for end of year. For now I have to put the game on the backburner as I experienced all it had to offer. I really like what's here, just know that there's only about 20 hours of gameplay and 10 hours of running around a lot. I would liken this game to an iceberg, you can experience only what's floating above, but there's a huge game waiting underneath once it's released. For now, you're supporting the dev and getting a glimpse of what they want to achieve.",
